1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,800
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,480
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,120
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,680
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,640
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,400
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,760
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,480
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,200
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,840
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,520
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:27,360
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,720
=The One=

16
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,280
=Episode 15=

17
00:00:32,719 --> 00:00:33,159
Talk.

18
00:00:34,119 --> 00:00:35,000
Who leaked it?

19
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:45,759
I really don't know

20
00:00:45,759 --> 00:00:47,799
what spell that woman cast on you.

21
00:00:48,439 --> 00:00:50,159
You're as hooked on her as my jerk dad.

22
00:00:51,759 --> 00:00:52,439
So...

23
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:54,000
you hate her.

24
00:00:54,679 --> 00:00:56,600
I hate women who use men to get ahead.

25
00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:59,920
I only like young, innocent guys.

26
00:01:01,719 --> 00:01:03,560
I liked you the moment I saw you.

27
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,239
Why can't you like me?

28
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:06,719
I promise

29
00:01:07,159 --> 00:01:09,640
I'd never play with your feelings.

30
00:01:13,159 --> 00:01:13,599
So...

31
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:16,799
you leaked the photos and the posts.

32
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:19,680
Her dear sister Su Ya did it.

33
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:21,359
Su Ya's an idiot.

34
00:01:22,319 --> 00:01:23,280
She was your pawn.

35
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,040
You were behind all of it.

36
00:01:28,959 --> 00:01:29,359
Yes.

37
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:32,480
I sent Su Ya the photos on purpose.

38
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:35,280
I used the Su family to ruin her.

39
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:37,480
I want the whole world to know

40
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:40,239
how filthy and disgusting Su Yan is.

41
00:01:40,519 --> 00:01:42,159
I want to ruin her reputation

42
00:01:42,439 --> 00:01:43,760
and turn everyone against her.

43
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:46,000
That's the price for seducing my father.

44
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:49,200
Your dad assaulted his student.

45
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,319
He is a monster.

46
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:52,359
And you're just a rabid dog
snapping at everyone.

47
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,319
You drugged my drink.

48
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,760
You're not going anywhere.

49
00:02:11,879 --> 00:02:12,680
Tonight...

50
00:02:15,199 --> 00:02:16,479
you're mine.

51
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:19,159
Hey, hey!

52
00:02:19,319 --> 00:02:20,120
What are you doing?

53
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:20,680
Hey!

54
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:21,520
What are you doing?

55
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,319
Take it. It's all yours.

56
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,000
Get out.

57
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,400
You little brat.

58
00:02:29,319 --> 00:02:30,800
Your parents may have money to burn,

59
00:02:30,879 --> 00:02:32,159
but he's my student.

60
00:02:32,719 --> 00:02:33,840
He thinks you're disgusting.

61
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,319
No amount of money will change that.

62
00:02:38,319 --> 00:02:38,879
Let's go, kid.

63
00:02:41,319 --> 00:02:43,360
He's way out of your league.

64
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:55,400
Ms. Su.

65
00:02:55,759 --> 00:02:57,080
He insisted I bring him here.

66
00:02:58,039 --> 00:02:59,000
He's all yours.

67
00:03:08,199 --> 00:03:08,719
Cheng Lin.

68
00:03:09,159 --> 00:03:10,039
Calm down.

69
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:14,800
Evidence.

70
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,000
Ge Yao's...

71
00:03:16,479 --> 00:03:17,080
recording.

72
00:03:38,199 --> 00:03:39,680
I'm going to take a cold shower.

73
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:51,599
I'll help you.

74
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:17,399
Hey, you...

75
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:19,079
That's freezing.

76
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:23,839
Su Yan.

77
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,120
Ease up on the ice cream.

78
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,399
It's not good for you.

79
00:04:27,519 --> 00:04:29,439
I hear people smoke after sex.

80
00:04:29,759 --> 00:04:30,360
But you...

81
00:04:30,879 --> 00:04:32,360
go for ice cream instead.

82
00:04:45,079 --> 00:04:45,839
So...

83
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:47,439
what are you going to do now?

84
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,079
The storm raging outside...

85
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:55,079
I used to be afraid of it.

86
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,600
But now that it's here,

87
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,439
I'm not scared anymore.

88
00:05:02,639 --> 00:05:04,680
Sometimes you have to go through things

89
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,399
to realize

90
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:08,279
how strong you really are.

91
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,120
So...

92
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:14,480
I'm going straight into the storm.

93
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,319
Even if I get hurt along the way,

94
00:05:17,519 --> 00:05:18,240
at least

95
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,519
I'll be true to myself.

96
00:05:27,399 --> 00:05:28,399
Your hands...

97
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:30,759
are they always this cold?

98
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,000
Are they?

99
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,839
I never noticed before.

100
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:41,279
Su Yan.

101
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:43,120
You once said

102
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:45,839
some roads have to be walked alone.

103
00:05:47,079 --> 00:05:49,040
But isn't it better with someone?

104
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:52,319
Like this stormy night,

105
00:05:53,199 --> 00:05:55,240
isn't it better if we face it together?

106
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,279
Su Yan.

107
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:03,319
You have to let others into your life.

108
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:07,839
Please, let me into your life.

109
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:09,600
Will you?

110
00:06:16,883 --> 00:06:18,363
(Su Yan.)

111
00:06:18,936 --> 00:06:19,763
(Tell me.)

112
00:06:20,634 --> 00:06:21,985
(What would make you feel better?)

113
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:25,720
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

114
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:29,240
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

115
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:32,760
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

116
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:36,520
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

117
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:55,000
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

118
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:58,640
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

119
00:06:58,640 --> 00:07:01,840
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

120
00:07:01,840 --> 00:07:05,520
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

121
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:08,920
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

122
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:12,600
♪I hum this song alone♪

123
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:16,440
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

124
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:20,520
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

125
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:23,800
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

126
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:27,400
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

127
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:30,880
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

128
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:35,760
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
